{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12970","headline":"同岑郎中屯田韦员外花树歌 · 独孤及","name":"同岑郎中屯田韦员外花树歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东风动地吹花发，渭城桃李千树雪。\n芳菲可爱不可留，武陵归客心欲绝。\n金华省郎惜佳辰，秪持棣蕚照青春。\n君家自是成蹊处，况有庭花作主人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"独孤及","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12970.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12970","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}